msgctxt "77\t137"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t227"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "233\t293"
msgid "You did good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "426\t566"
msgid ""
"Sounds like Kanda got a nice little\\n"
"visit from the fourth chairman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "585\t686"
msgid "Whole family's gone up in flames."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "734\t850"
msgid "Impressive he did it all single-handedly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "867\t990"
msgid ""
"But I suppose the Dragon of Dojima's\\n"
"still got some bite in him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1125\t1284"
msgid ""
"It's safe to say Kiryu-san'll keep\\n"
"poking around this Okinawa business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1310\t1467"
msgid ""
"By now the guy's probably long known\\n"
"you're wrapped up in the whole shebang, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1746\t1926"
msgid ""
"Meaning the next place he'll show...\\n"
"is right at your feet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2123\t2292"
msgid ""
"I brought you into this Okinawa deal.\\n"
"So I guess it's my fault if he comes after you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2307\t2526"
msgid ""
"But it's worth it for you.\\n"
"Building this resort'll net your family an easy 100 bil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2736\t2941"
msgid ""
"Just so happens that also makes you\\n"
"the key suspect in the sixth chairman's shooting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2973\t3036"
msgid "...Majima-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3106\t3214"
msgid "I want Kamurocho all to myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3227\t3350"
msgid "So. You know what has to be done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3603\t3749"
msgid ""
"You've got the most to lose if Kiryu-san\\n"
"gets in our way, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3828\t3920"
msgid "Doesn't matter how you do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3963\t4095"
msgid ""
"Just do it.\\n"
"Or your head's the one that'll roll."
msgstr ""